  lines:
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.15
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Congratulations, Inspector. You've completed your first point-of-view review.
      Now select a disposition.
    holdSeconds: 5.678302
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: The nightmare response was handled well. The unit calmed Noah successfully,
      and Daniel and Emily requested the upgrade themselves.
    holdSeconds: 8.319811
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: Both dispositions come from the inspection manual. I recommend approving
      the Night Companion Pro upgrade.
    holdSeconds: 6.810377
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  - presentationKind: 0
    startDelay: 0.18
    speaker: Field Unit
    text: That approach has been validated across a larger number of households.
    holdSeconds: 5.3009434
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    durationMode: 0
    voiceTailSeconds: 0.12
  postSequenceDelay: 0.18
